# Keep build contexts small and secrets out of images.
.git
.github
.claude
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.data
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
benchmark
docs
supabase
# The web app deploys to Vercel; only its manifest is needed (a frozen install checks every workspace importer).
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
**/*.mp4
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
